Robert,

Thank you for submitting your request for records. To my knowledge the Oreg=
on Department of Geology and Mineral Industries does not have records respo=
nsive to your request.

Respectfully,

Brianna Weaver | Office Operations Assistant

Oregon Department of Geology and Mineral Industries

229 Broadalbin St SW Albany, OR 97321-2246

Cell: (541) 801-1127 | Fax: (541) 967-2075

Brianna.Weaver@dogami.oregon.gov<mailto:Brianna.Weaver@dogami.oregon.gov>| =
www.oregon.gov/dogami<http://www.oregon.gov/dogami>


Beginning Monday, October 26, 2026, the Department will temporarily pause i=
ts acceptance of new and amended permit and certificate applications, trans=
fer of permit applications, and requests for closure. This pause is being i=
mplemented in support of the transition to the Department=92s new electroni=
c permitting system, DEPS. The pause is expected to remain in effect until =
the applicable DEPS modules launch early 2027. Applicants are encouraged to=
 prepare their materials in advance for submission through DEPS. For more i=
nformation, visit the MLRR website<https://www.oregon.gov/dogami/mlrr/Pages=
/default.aspx> or the DEPS webpage<https://www.oregon.gov/dogami/mlrr/Pages=
/deps.aspx>.


